 cloth they use for dead people?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_64","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_65","text":"Why would you want that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_66","text":"It's a bit awkward saying it out loud, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_67","text":"should I ever fall in battle, then I'll be all set.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_68","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_68","text":"All set? What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_69","text":"If I die in battle,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_70","text":"it's not like I'll be able to pick out my outfit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_weare","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_71","text":"And the dead should not wear the clothing of the living.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_72","text":"That'd be a major breach of battlefield etiquette.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_73","text":"But then how is it okay for someone living to wear what dead people wear?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_74","text":"You could consider it a form of higher awareness.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_75","text":"It signifies that I am at peace with the possibility of dying in any given battle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_76","text":"Er... I don't think I quite follow you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_77","text":"If I accept the fact I might die on the battlefield, I'm basically resigning myself to being killed. I'm admitting defeat before the battle's even begun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_78","text":"Wouldn't it be better to focus on how to make it out alive?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_79","text":"That's what I think, anyway. That's why I always inspect my weapons and equipment from top to bottom, including my combat uniform.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_80","text":"Because I want to come back alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_81","text":"That's a valid outlook as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_82","text":"But life is unpredictable. You can't have it all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_83","text":"So, you could consider my outlook as me merely preparing for the worst.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_84","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_85","text":"I think I can understand that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_86","text":"Okay, I'm done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_87","text":"Thanks, let me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_88","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_89","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_89","text":"The previous areas that were torn have been covered up with a hodge-podge of patches stacked atop each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_herecomestrouble","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_90","text":"I can respect your concept of giving it your all in a fight,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_91","text":"but I can't agree with accepting your own death before you've set foot on the battlefield.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_92","text":"So, I stacked you up with four layers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_93","text":"That baby's capable of blocking the heaviest of artillery shells, so you won't be dying anytime soon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_94","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_94","text":"Aren't you going a bit overboard?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_95","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_96","text":"Do you like it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_97","text":"Um... yes, I guess...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_98","text":"Great.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_99","text":"Let me know if there's anything else I can do for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_100","text":"... {AccountData.NickName}-kun?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_101","text":"Can you put your arm around my waist and walk with me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_102","text":"It's because this patch that Delta so kindly made for me is so...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_103","text":"precious that I don't want just anyone to have the privilege of seeing it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_05_104","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_05_104","text":"Gladly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}